{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d75342116ec32b75","name":"Targeting Scope","source":{"id":"source:reference-d75342116ec32b75","title":"Targeting Scope","revision":24958,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:09:45Z","sha256":"dd2d2bbeb8ce388739b90a5a99716bd999ac415267f4d30233ce1cf26b5a414a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24958","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Targeting%20Scope&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d75342116ec32b75","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TARGETING SCOPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["UPGRADE POINT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/UPGRADE_POINT"}," COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Standard\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["100\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.2 kg\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Enhanced Low-Light\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1.2 kg\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Targeting Scope is a sighting device that makes it easier to hit distant targets. However, it affords a very limited field of view, making it difficult to use. Installing a Targeting Scope on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," requires 10 minutes, and a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Standard: "]},"A Standard Targeting Scope reduces the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," by one category (for example, from Medium to Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},"). However, you must ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," at your target to gain this benefit, and you lose the benefit if you change targets or lose line of sight to your target."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhanced low-light: "]},"An Enhanced Low-Light Targeting Scope functions the same as a Standard Targeting Scope in normal light. However, after ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," at a target, it allows the wielder to ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") from darkness when attacking that target."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Let's say I have a sniper with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," Feat who ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aims"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aims"}," before making a single attack with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon that has a Targeting Scope. Do any of these effects stack with one another?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," with a Targeting Scope, and using an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon all stack, providing progressively better attacks against distant targets. I can see how the precise interaction might be a bit confusing, so here are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties (Point-Blank, Short, Medium, and Long) for each combination:\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},"):"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["With no other modifiers: Point-Blank +0, Short -2, Medium -5, Long -10"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," OR ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a Targeting Scope: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium -2, Long -5"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," AND ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a Targeting Scope: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long -2"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sporting Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sporting_Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:71fc5e161a6b812a"},"):"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["With no other modifiers: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium -5, Long -10"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," OR ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a Targeting Scope: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long -5"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," AND ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a Targeting Scope: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long +0"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Thus, if a trained sniper with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Far Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Far_Shot","referenceId":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f"}," Feat uses a good sniping weapon (anything with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," quality plus a mounted Targeting Scope) and takes the time to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"},", that sniper can attack a target at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," without taking a penalty on the attack roll.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
